Table: ZORDER_MAN
Description: Maintenance Order persistent table

Key fields:
- CLIENT
- ORDER_ID

Foreign keys / relationships:
- EQUIPMENT_ID -> ZEQUIPMENT-EQUI_ID

Business fields:
- PRIORITY (ZPRIOR_DE)
- STATUS (CHAR 10)
- REPORTED_BY (CHAR 40)
- DESCRIPTION (CHAR 60)
- CREATION_DATE (TIMESTAMP)
- COMPLETION_DATE (TIMESTAMP)

Administrative fields:
- CREATED_BY
- CREATED_AT
- LOCAL_LAST_CHANGED_BY
- LOCAL_LAST_CHANGED_AT

Usage:
- Persistent storage for the Maintenance Order RAP Business Object
- Supports draft-enabled managed RAP scenario
- Status field is controlled by RAP actions and validations
